{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33370","headline":"赋得郎官上应列宿 · 公乘亿","name":"赋得郎官上应列宿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"北极伫文昌，南宫晓拜郎。\n紫泥乘帝泽，银印佩天光。\n纬结三台侧，钩连四辅傍。\n佐商依傅说，仕汉笑冯唐。\n委佩摇秋色，峨冠带晚霜。\n自然符列象，千古耀岩廊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"公乘亿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33370.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33370","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}